aśekhara Kavi"},"title":["Śrī Tulasī-parikramā-gīti"],"author":["by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi"],"verses":[{"text":["namo namaḥ tulasī mahārāṇī,","vṛnde mahārāṇī namo namaḥ"],"translation":["O Tulasī Mahārāṇī, O Vṛnda Devī, I offer my obeisances unto you again and again."],"isLong":false},{"number":"1","text":["namo re namo re māiyā namo nārāyaṇi"],"translation":["O Nārāyaṇi I offer you my obeisances again and again."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["jāko daraśe, paraśe agha-nāśa-hoi","mahimā veda-purāṇe bākhāni"],"translation":["By seeing or touching you all sins are destroyed. Your glories are sung in the Vedas and Purāṇas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["jāko patra, mañjarī komala","śrī-pati-charaṇa-kamale lapaṭāni","dhanya tulasi, pūraṇa tapa kiye,","śrī-śālagrāma-mahā-pāṭarāṇī"],"translation":["Your leaves and soft mañjarīs are entwined at the lotus feet of Lord Nārāyaṇa. O Tulasī by your performance of austerity you have become the worshipful consort of Śrī Śālagrām Śila."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["dhūpa, dīpa, naivedya, āroti,","phulanā kiye varakhā varakhāni","chāppānna bhoga, chatriśa vyañjana,","vinā tulasī prabhu eka nāhi māni"],"translation":["You shower your mercy upon anyone who offers you incense, lamp, foodstuffs, worship and flowers. The Lord does not accept even one of fifty-six food offerings or thirty-six curries offered without Tulasī leaves."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["śiva-śuka-nārada, āur brahmādiko,","ḍhuḍata phirata mahā-muni jñānī","chandraśekhara māiyā, terā jaśa gāoye","bhakati-dāna dījiye mahārāṇi"],"translation":["Lord Shiva, Śukadeva Goswāmī, Nārada Muni, all the demigods headed by Lord Brahmā, the mystics and great munis are all circumambulating you. O Tulasī Mahārāṇī, thus Chandraśekhara sings of your glories. Please bestow upon him the gift of devotion."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/05-namo-namah-tulasi-maharani-13","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-shri-tulasi","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/025-namonamahtulasimaharani-2","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/namo-namah-tulasi-maharani","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/namo-namah-tulasi-maharani/","description":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā-gīti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Śrī Tulasī-parikramā-gīti. by Śrīla Chandraśekhara Kavi | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"namo-namah-tulasi-maharani"}}